{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_01",
      "hash": "1e93a31dc54be178",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳來了！\\n寶可夢圖鑑收集得如何？\\c\\n來……\\n讓我幫[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳看看！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_02",
      "hash": "1e93a61dc54be691",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "…………寶可夢圖鑑\\n現在的完成度是……\\c\\n發現的寶可夢有[VAR NUM3(0004)]種！\\n捉到的寶可夢有[VAR NUM3(0005)]種！\\c\\n大木博士的評價是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_03",
      "hash": "1e93a51dc54be4de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看來……還需要多努力呢。\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要多到各地的草叢去\\r\\n多多捕捉寶可夢啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_04",
      "hash": "1e93a81dc54be9f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳漸漸進入狀態啦！\\n投球的姿勢肯定也愈來愈像樣了吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_05",
      "hash": "1e93a71dc54be844",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還需要多充實一點內容，\\n才能稱得上是寶可夢圖鑑呢！\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳再四處走走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_06",
      "hash": "1e93aa1dc54bed5d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很努力呢！\\n我把評定功能交給了\\c\\n在11號道路閘口那裡的助手！\\n記得去拿啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_07",
      "hash": "1e93a91dc54bebaa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "圖鑑看起來不錯嘛！\\n我把球球組合交給了\\c\\n在16號道路閘口那裡的助手！\\n記得去拿啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_08",
      "hash": "1e939c1dc54bd593",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "終於超過50種啦！\\n我把超厲害的道具交給了\\c\\n在15號道路閘口那裡的助手！\\n記得去拿啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_09",
      "hash": "1e939b1dc54bd3e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喔！這真不賴。\\n寶可夢圖鑑逐漸成形了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_10",
      "hash": "1e901e1dc548c9a2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "狀態很好嘛！\\n海裡跟河裡還有水屬性寶可夢呢！\\r\\n想捉牠們就要用水上飄啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_11",
      "hash": "1e901f1dc548cb55",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真精彩！\\n莫非[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很喜歡收集東西！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_12",
      "hash": "1e901c1dc548c63c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀……真厲害！\\n要收集這麼多想必很不容易吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_13",
      "hash": "1e901d1dc548c7ef",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "終於超過100種了！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳實在是能幹得令人難以置信啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_14",
      "hash": "1e901a1dc548c2d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "連寶可夢的進化形態\\n也收集到了……太了不起啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_15",
      "hash": "1e901b1dc548c489",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好極了！和朋友交換\\n說不定就能收集更多。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_16",
      "hash": "1e90181dc548bf70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能把圖鑑收集到這種程度，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳已經稱得上是專家了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_17",
      "hash": "1e90191dc548c123",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我無話可說了！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就是寶可夢博士！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_18",
      "hash": "1e90261dc548d73a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳終於把圖鑑完成了！\\n恭喜！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_ookido_01_p18_zukan",
      "hash": "f8903db79b5f3656",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 18]"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_ookido_01_p19_zukan",
      "hash": "0197460e650a9831",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_19",
      "hash": "1e90271dc548d8ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "終於……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳終於\\n完成了這個非常棒、\\r\\n非常完美的寶可夢圖鑑！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_20",
      "hash": "1e8c981dc545b019",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦哦哦哦哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_21",
      "hash": "1e8c971dc545ae66",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n真的太感謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！\\r\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳實現了我的夢想！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub069_doctor_22",
      "hash": "1e8c961dc545acb3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳來了！\\n寶可夢圖鑑收集得如何？\\c\\n哇哈哈……！\\n雖然我已經知道結果，\\r\\n還是忍不住想確認一下！\\c\\n我看看……"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_069_max",
